distractor_rationale.B:
Stateful firewalls handle connection-based and volumetric traffic very differently;
        connection tracking protects against spoofed sessions but does not throttle
        raw volumetric flood traffic.

distractor_rationale.D:
Making risks visible to leadership supports decision-making but does not
        substitute for technical controls. Documentation is a management-layer control;
        it must be paired with technical mitigations to be effective.
